WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.660
Olopa plot, read by a computer voice.

2
00:00:02.910 --> 00:00:08.504
Soil: watch. The satellite saw 2 months with little cover, none bare.

3
00:00:08.754 --> 00:00:13.550
Burning: watch. Fires seen nearby in 1 of 15 years.

4
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:19.949
Midsummer drought: good. No dry spell went past 15 days in 25 years.

5
00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:25.694
All three options come out even: what you plant today, maize with jack bean and short-cycle maize.

6
00:00:25.944 --> 00:00:29.814
This is not an official notice: talk it over with your extension worker.
